{"route":{"id":"17143","name":"GR92: Cala Montjoi-Cadaqués","intro":"Aquesta entretinguda ruta que <strong>ressegueix el GR92 en el tram entre Cala Montjoi i Cadaqués</strong>, transcorre pràcticament en la seva totalitat dins del <strong>Parc Natural del Cap de Creus.</strong> Recorre algunes de les més espectaculars <strong>cales del nord de la costa Brava</strong>, com és el cas de <strong>Cala Calitjàs, Cala Pedrosa o Cala Jóncols.</strong> Resseguirem el <strong>litoral del Parc Natural del Cap de Creus</strong> de cala en cala i creuarem l'impressionant <strong>Cap de Norfeu</strong> tot dirigint-nos al petit poble de <strong>Cadaqués. </strong>","tipus":"Lineal","dificultat":"Mitjana","durada":"2 hores 51 minuts","desnivell":"387.00 meters","distancia":"10.00 km","tema":"Flora i fauna, Medi","imgs":["n17143_1.jpg","n17143_2.jpg","n17143_3.jpg","n17143_4.jpg"],"url":"https://naturalocal.net/ca/rutes-senderisme-catalunya/rutes-senderisme-girona/rutes-senderisme-roses/gr92-cala-montjoi-cadaques","track":[[42.24927,3.2266],[42.24927,3.2266],[42.24934,3.22661],[42.24939,3.2266],[42.24947,3.22651],[42.24955,3.22658],[42.24957,3.22669],[42.24961,3.22679],[42.2497,3.22685],[42.24981,3.22689],[42.2499,3.22696],[42.25001,3.22692],[42.2501,3.22683],[42.25017,3.22674],[42.25031,3.22671],[42.25043,3.22675],[42.25057,3.22673],[42.25066,3.22677],[42.25073,3.22686],[42.25081,3.22695],[42.25088,3.22706],[42.25095,3.22714],[42.25101,3.22723],[42.25108,3.22734],[42.25115,3.22743],[42.25119,3.22755],[42.25123,3.22766],[42.25129,3.22778],[42.25132,3.2279],[42.25135,3.228],[42.25141,3.22811],[42.25148,3.2282],[42.25152,3.22833],[42.25156,3.22846],[42.2516,3.22858],[42.25167,3.22866],[42.25177,3.22867],[42.25184,3.22864],[42.25193,3.22863],[42.25208,3.22873],[42.25216,3.22886],[42.25224,3.22901],[42.25232,3.22911],[42.25232,3.22924],[42.25223,3.22933],[42.25213,3.22941],[42.25204,3.22946],[42.25196,3.22953],[42.25189,3.2296],[42.25185,3.22971],[42.25185,3.22985],[42.25182,3.22999],